Implement Enterprise Asset-Based Migration Planning Workflow

Please enhance and Improve the Migration Planner page located at:

http://localhost:3000/dashboard/migration-planner

to support a complete Asset-Centric Migration Planning workflow suitable for enterprise environments.

The objective is to allow organizations to manage, review, prioritize, and migrate each discovered asset independently while maintaining complete consistency across the entire QGuard Helix platform.

Primary Objectives

Instead of displaying a single combined migration plan for all discovered assets, implement an Asset Selection system that allows users to review and migrate each asset individually.

This will significantly improve usability for organizations with dozens or hundreds of assets while preventing confusion regarding which assets require migration first.

1. Asset Selection Panel

Create a premium Enterprise Asset Selector positioned on the left side (or another appropriate location) of the Migration Planner.

Each discovered asset should appear as an individual selectable item.

Each asset card should display at minimum:

Asset Name
Asset Type
Hostname / Domain / IP
Environment
