Implement a single source of truth using the existing backend APIs and database.

4. Send Selected Asset to Live Migration

After reviewing an asset, users should be able to initiate migration directly from the Migration Planner.

Add a prominent Enterprise CTA such as:

"Send to Live Migration"

or

"Queue for Migration"

When clicked:

Pass the selected Asset ID
Pass the current migration plan
Pass remediation recommendations
Pass validation results
Pass migration priority
Pass dependencies
Pass rollback configuration
Pass readiness status

Navigate to:

http://localhost:3000/dashboard/live-migration

The Live Migration page should automatically load the selected asset and prepare it for execution.

No manual re-selection should be required.

